==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|enm}}, from {{etyl|ang}} ''[[þiccet]]'' from ''[[þicce]]'' "thick" + {{etyl|ang}} nominal suffix {{term|-et||lang=ang}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪkɪt}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[dense]], but generally [[small]],  [[growth]] of [[shrub]]s, [[bush]]es or small [[tree]]s; a [[copse]].
# {{context|computing|figuratively}} The [[collection]] of many small linked [[file]]s created when a [[document]] is saved in [[HTML]] format by some [[word processor]]s and [[web site]] creation [[software]].

